<view wx:if="{{singlePage}}" class="timeline-notice">正在预览。使用路线、编辑行程，请点击底部“前往小程序”。</view>
<view wx:if="{{route}}" class="route-page with-dock">
  <view class="route-hero"><image wx:if="{{coverPhoto}}" src="{{coverPhoto}}" mode="{{route.photoPortrait ? 'aspectFit' : 'aspectFill'}}" class="route-hero-photo" bindtap="preview" lazy-load/><view class="route-hero-shade"></view><view class="route-hero-top"><text class="route-badge">{{route.tag}}</text><text class="route-serial">ROUTE {{route.number}}</text></view><view class="route-hero-copy"><view class="route-region">{{regions}}</view><view class="route-hero-title">{{route.title}}</view><view class="route-hero-subtitle">{{route.subtitle}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="route-content">
    <view class="route-overview"><view class="overview-item"><text class="overview-value">{{days.length}}<text> 天</text></text><text class="overview-label">参考安排</text></view><view class="overview-item"><text class="overview-value">{{stopCount}}<text> 个</text></text><text class="overview-label">游览地点</text></view><view class="overview-note"><view>可以照着走，</view><view>也可以重新安排。</view></view></view>
    <view class="route-intro">{{route.intro}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:for-item="day" wx:key="day" class="route-day"><view class="day-heading"><view class="day-title"><text class="day-no">{{day.day}}</text><text>第 {{day.day}} 天</text></view><text class="day-count">{{day.places.length}} 个地点</text></view><view class="day-stops"><view wx:for="{{day.places}}" wx:key="id" class="stop-row"><view class="stop-track"><text class="stop-dot">{{index + 1}}</text><view wx:if="{{index + 1 < day.places.length}}" class="stop-line"></view></view><view class="stop-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail" hover-class="pressed"><image wx:if="{{item.photo}}" src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill" class="stop-photo" lazy-load/><view class="stop-copy"><view class="stop-region">{{item.region}} · {{item.category}}</view><view class="stop-title">{{item.shortName || item.name}}</view><view class="stop-time">{{item.durationText}}</view></view><text class="stop-arrow">›</text></view></view></view></view>
    <view class="route-notes"><view class="notes-heading">这样安排，更从容</view><view wx:for="{{route.notes}}" wx:key="*this" class="route-note"><text class="note-number">0{{index + 1}}</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="reference-note"><view class="reference-label">关于这条路线</view><view>这是供你调整的地点组合，不提供实时交通或导航。出发前再核对路程、营业安排与票务。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{coverCredit}}" class="cover-credit">封面图片：{{coverCredit}}</view><view class="route-end">万绿智游 · 留出余量，慢慢逛</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!singlePage}}" class="dock route-dock"><button class="secondary" open-type="share">分享路线</button><button class="primary" bindtap="use">用这条路线安排 <text>→</text></button></view>
</view>
<view wx:else class="page"><view class="empty"><view class="empty-title">路线暂不可用</view><view class="small muted">可以从首页重新选择一条路线。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="home">回到首页</button></view></view>
